cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AutoCDAScorer: Automatically Score Cell Death Areas in Agroinfiltration Images"
abstract: "Scores cell death areas (CDAs) in UV agroinfiltration images of Nicotiana benthamiana leaves. Deep learning and ordinal regression models give each CDA a cell death severity score from 0 (no cell death) to 6 (strong cell death). Diagnostic plots show whether new images resemble the training images."
authors:
